raye-archive (0.5~beta1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First release: the Raye archive engine, its library and the
    raye-archive command line tool.
  * Opens ZIP, 7z, RAR, tar, gz, bz2, xz, zst, lz4, br, ISO, CAB, cpio,
    ar and rpm, and creates 7z, ZIP and tar. RAR is read only.
  * Decodes 7-Zip's multithreaded 7z archives on several cores.
  * Refuses an archive whose declared size is far past its own, and does
    not follow links that loop back up when compressing.

